{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rohIxANufgsTn5ClZbqrTg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:34.773479+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rohIxANufgsTn5ClZbqrTg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w9TcHvv27fsnYYcsxt5lgCl43dBO4ySFk3aA3swfZxhglLZKLvmKvhibcnMhsD8L3DXO0pRlnoZdGib4Z4TgFrpg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S2ic3QjyKBh5JAwcuIN7lwv5ofTZor4ibOZQSJJBE6xibn8phfibKaxR50bzdtazN2gs6o1sbuTFSrsoCjQqPzZu2iaycib7dWiaBChas/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>为增进国内高校优秀本科生对中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院生物医学与健康工程研究所（以下简称“医工所”）生物医学工程学科的了解，促进相互沟通与交流，激发大学生的科研兴趣，</span></span></span><span><span>选拔有培养潜质的优秀学生，医工所将于2026年8月初举办</span></span><span><strong><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营线下活动</span></span></strong></span><span><span>。医</span></span><span><span><span>工所将提供</span></span><span><span><span><span>一流的科研条件和</span></span></span></span><span><span>丰厚的奖助学金，如果你热爱医工，志在科研，赶紧报名吧！</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S0lTEDokGBHovpjdv4DTicdssHOiaQyPYnG1KG17kgWoSp1Hp2huKa0GXCfibic8RkXW8K7FoVdsEHFmP2X0uicQs353BHfg4zO60MI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>医工所介绍</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>医工所是中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院下属的九个研究平台之一，成立于2007年8月15日，是中国科学院规模最大的生物医学与健康工程领域的研究单元之一。面向生物医学工程学科前沿、人民健康重大需求和高端医疗器械产业需求，以 \" 学术引领 , 服务产业 \" 为指导思想，实现 \" 新诊断 \"、\" 新智疗 \"，和医学人工智能三大方向在核心技术、关键部件及系统的突破 , 推动临床医学技术现代化进程 , 引领产业发展，服务人民健康 ,打造世界一流、国内顶尖生物医学工程研究所。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>共有10个研究单元：保罗C·劳特伯生物医学成像研究中心、转化医学研究与发展中心、仿生触觉与智能传感研究中心、医学人工智能研究中心、生物医学光学与分子影像研究中心、智能医用材料与器械研究中心、灵长类神经调控与影像解析研究中心、先进探测材料与医学成像器件研究中心、脑机接口研究中心、医疗机器人微型研究中心。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片4.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S0TeibxuOPVice1B42QRFuAJgvk7vf0otpAn0Tibm7l9RkSZrXKjBcNe1sicXtEDICzkWdDcE7AHtk95QTaEo4lyQ2CnibYWv4wsJkQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>已形成一支七百余人的研究队伍，其中正高级45人，副高级91人，中初级183人。现有国家级人才22名，省部级人才39名，市级人才146名，其中包括中国科学院院士1名，青年科学基金（A 类）4名， 万人计划科技领军３名，青年科学基金（B类）9 名，万人计划青年拔尖1名，海外高层次青年人才4名。</span></span><span><strong><span><span><span>项目争取方面</span></span></span></strong></span><span><span>，获批科研项目约2840项，总合同经费累计达36.5亿元；</span></span><span><strong><span><span><span>学术成果方面</span></span></span></strong></span><span><span>，发表国际顶级期刊在内的SCI论文3597篇；</span></span><span><strong><span><span><span>产业化进展方面</span></span></span></strong></span><span><span>，授权专利1117项, PCT专利742项，转化金额超6亿元。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S0F80MNRg7Gs4vH3jZFAOYNugsUFWEgwRyuPjU7EibP9mcrCbvaHI9j9XbboFvXKlGKY1nmmbDFYQLfvDBhzjkjQic0w83eTiccq8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>已组建包含全国重点实验室、工程实验室和技术平台31个，已搭建劳特伯医学影像实验室等国际先进、国内一流的专业实验室30余个。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S07S128OA41iaf9D135SH998kxa5S9aEz8gLveSswBIA38E6L3va54lWtUoGUOnhprGooUqHny73KTI22xMymGzWvooib7iaXySv4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S1jzuuqxvh0DCySZaXXUaNgoD2O8eFI2swuk6rAJBo4TRicBvFO8RvzMlJ5DGpl0NVePEzY4GFItzniaGEmnXBpJNzjIoeFZ6hfo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>夏令营介绍</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>为增进学科交流，激发学生科研兴趣，本届夏令营将由医工所研究员带领30-40名左右营员，开展学术交流、破冰活动、实验室参观、名师对话等活动。医工所将提供免费食宿、纪念品等，报销从学校/家庭所在地至深圳的单程交通费用（按火车（汽车）硬座或硬卧或动车二等座标准）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><ul><li><p><strong><span><span>开营时间</span></span></strong><span><span>：2026年8月3-6日（以后续通知安排为准）</span></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><span>报名方式</span></span></strong><span><span>：线上报名（见后文）</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>报名截止时间</span></span></strong></span><span><span>：2026年7月14日23:59</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><strong><span><span>报销相关事项</span></span></strong></span><span><span>：保留好所有车票/机票、行程单、登机牌等报销票据，请于报到当天提交，提交方式见后续通知。</span></span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S3rbUOnqw0eqXEZAG2yRt2KgGFejeqUMvlhNDIwQDQ0dkibwrByDCMlDlhX3c6DVRnEUSmAibQkUyZvm4MJQlLk3bCxic8d8DMdMc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S2icZ7MRPUia2I5vudWmQwETDVyzxCLSibRpk0sP9ms5IXDBQNF3Z6tm6pHHG5tJGLu3rVnZkSqgfBSOy39wJ1qIIIWxKrtfLq5AI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S17Hu9AZkp6dm9FrN9NFEWUbZodfMIUPKYyB4xFMuDg1lf5BupaTH5VabZGBmH6f8brdl426tZvicg4WswDnUUziaO6EaeLUpyEA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S1WiaDzBNibsPyNiar3VIWP5L4lvJnc9k0ia2dkic844jcobPTmoicV4HTs0kNmgEIiaUkCA1lCPGkt8MzwibSPFQAiaJFdhztQYDaicQpCM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S3ppBiap2YuUy3DNk04dyKoRKLJcmtMflicCVckzvSvia6ib8Yy7bZtXt2m9iaYKI7tOhmyP4MRO9Xxs20cq82Sg5K6Ztyhibsia5w19k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S1TvgzQMRyhhzxYwstuxpiaqlicf9LDicrH3ZNTQ1CI8e1lO2Qo7pknucfD2ehY5DcG5U84YmfYf3aRZlXLtdtuG0H3klmiaBjpPbA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S2J81pq5icibLRXsO5HbEATnxhpCxM3ptm6kzSSNKO0MnmMuFfTvJ9E3icJ4f2RUu1XmS3YGR1bmribRJLUbzU0EAIDcojp4jms1Mw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>往期精彩活动照片 →</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S3wtYsxGZ72AgZCfFO2gDILkqFAg80kNCZ82FF4uwPKrwk9BZhqibJibpNpsygiaasP8b6o3GrcKbwMfUP5OXU5uY3LUtcNPxW2a4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.全国高校2027年应届本科毕业生（“双一流”高校本科生优先考虑）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.具有生物医学工程、电子信息、计算机、光学、生物材料、生物学、化学、物理、机械、医学、药学等相关或相近理工科专业基础；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.学习成绩优秀（本科前三学年学习成绩专业排名前30%），英语水平良好；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.认同中国科学院大学的教育理念，对生物医学工程相关领域兴趣浓厚，有志于从事学术研究工作，科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力，学风端正，品德良好</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.预计可获得或已获得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S09HRAvgibl4icAYTLl9bENFSIP5twAy6YmMPOGyZgsOrFJrXxpx9CxjKibSyCgRcaJht1C21HjpHBQdQBCiaUvyS8hfqNiaVBt7giaM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>①第</span></span><span><span>一步：中国科学院大学官网</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>登陆中国科学院科教结合协同育人行动计划（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/），选择“大学生夏令营报名”栏目按要求进行网上报名申请并导出报名表签字。填报时请仔细阅读系统首页的“填报说明”和“常见问题解答”，</span></span><strong><span><span><span>夏令营承办单位请选择“深圳先进技术研究院”，意向研究方向请填写分营名称“医工所”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>②第二步：医工所报名及材料提交。</span></span><span><span><span>扫描下方二维码或</span></span></span><span><span>电脑登陆腾讯文档报名链接完成报名。</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S1Ho7n1icQumfMnxsELjAnLJJNFyt3gccFKNyPtCSsficyIicGKKDWL9fOfFd4bIQIcKK1KSqW7Gt5gHYgbia2P1CIUxL5wyaBmSHg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DYXVESk9xb0hsY3hK</span></span></span><span><span>（腾讯文档报名链接）报名的学生需准备以下申请材料，在“第二步”报名链接中上传以下材料：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.个人简历（1-2页）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.中国科学院深圳先进院2026年夏令营申请表，需网上报名后下载</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.本科成绩单和专业排名证明，需加盖教务处公章</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.英文能力证明（包括大学英语四、六级；雅思；托福或GRE等）</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.学生证和身份证复印件</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.推免资格证明（如有请提供）</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.其他证明材料（高亮本人姓名。如已发表论文、市级以上证书奖状、较厚的论文或出版物提供论文首页或出版物摘要即可。）</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>8.背景调查问卷。</span></span><span><span><span><span>扫描下方二维码</span></span></span></span><span><span>附件模板下载后填写。</span></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kfQ2kgjL6S2OicH8F7QkU6aIIcBeJULr9rnXDwWLD9xuSQasnTgKhCHiaBicPqtP2MGiaFI3uVic0R4FfkqXlROWZUBYCkDO5UbYFDRzFicg6BKZU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（以上材料请按顺序整合进一个PDF文件内，命名为：姓名+专业+学校+医工所。存储空间有限，请同学们将文件压缩至最小。要求每份电子材料A4纸打印后清晰可见，如影响阅读，视为无效材料。）</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S3XfW9POQtwPBINCajbPS2C1w2LL8zblGMuelNjuTpsJHrKwym3C9Am2PtpySibhgUtPUOejvZk7Adk6mZIlJ79FomyI6VGicHEs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>入营审核及录取</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.夏令营工作小组将对申请人进行资格审核和入营遴选，名额有限</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.入选者将会收到邮件通知，未入选不再另行通知。获选学生预计将于7月下旬收到通知，请留意入营确认邮件，逾期未回复默认为放弃入营</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.夏令营期间将通过面试等考核方式选拔优秀营员。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>注意事项：</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.请遵守活动相关纪律要求和安排，按时参加活动，严格遵守深圳先进院相关规章制度；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.申请信息需真实有效，不得弄虚作假，若有不实信息，将撤销其资格，并追缴已提供的各项资助。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S1ltQlq3EqSUdib0cDO31icYpsaJaPwUibvT0PmuoXDDWCwvewVBriaJDP7lDB4QhSWF3RDhyYP73UhJ14aKOUiad3TzUrYpURjqrZ0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：黄老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：ygs-edu@siat.ac.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：深圳市南山区西丽大学城学苑大道1068号</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kfQ2kgjL6S0yviaXu5qhhk7sUtib4lB6VYhWsvuhJIet30LfUECShvZhUwaygtGbxcCahNrv93sPic69EVnGQbnOpdHXYvrTqLvibQ0sq6hasmw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>往期推荐</span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?action=getalbum&amp;__biz=Mzg4MDgxMzk0MA==&amp;scene=1&amp;album_id=3102173783752491009&amp;count=3#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w9TcHvv27ftkhnVIib8Ruw04oQkIvxreOYEH2A6qe0blaSXqpJow7BU0ibXYJb5uu41oBcSPWt2B7ercHyibbYDaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" title=\"44.png\"/></span></a></section><section><section><p><span>医工所科研进展</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>文章/编辑：医工所所部</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w9TcHvv27ftDNCV9LKpPScwvW2b6dfZeOezjqic50o6Isn8q93mckQRdZcJ0rTzLrVt5GhygyKHECUoGWicTUXqg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b4290faa05e45c699dbec78314585c5507302d47d9d512975441e3c8b9a947ab","textLength":2233,"sourceSha256":"44c0d7c1cdbf93c890d9511b004169dc021975331c2c3a03faa4061e637552fb","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b9f21627003897c188b5","title":"2026年中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院生物医学与健康工程研究所2026年优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:34.773479+00:00"}
